            <div xml:id="d949">

                <pb facs="0984" n="864" xml:id="pg864"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Legation of Sweden and
                            Norway to the Department of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Memorandum.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Sweden and Norway</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-10-27"><hi rendition="#italic">October 27,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The legation has just received from the foreign office at Stockholm a telegram
                    announcing that after the consent given by the Swedish Diet the King has
                    yesterday, the 26th, recognized Norway as entirely separated from Sweden and has
                    renounced the crown of Norway for himself and his house.</p>
                <p>The legation has been ordered to inform the Government of the United States of
                    the above said statement and to add that a circular note to the powers, which is
                    now on its way by mail, will in a more formal manner bring the subject to the
                    knowledge of the United States Government.</p>
            </div>
